Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_YouveMadeItToMe::
    .string "Wahahahaha! You reached me!\p"
    .string "Nobody reaches me. That is the\n"
    .string "entire point of me.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_YoureIgnoringMe::
    .string "You are ignoring me. In my own\n"
    .string "house.\p"
    .string "…Go on, then. The scroll is over\n"
    .string "there.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToPlantTrees::
    .string "I was up all night planting those\n"
    .string "trees.\p"
    .string "Indoors. In pots. Do not ask.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToPreparePanels::
    .string "I was up all night wiring those\n"
    .string "floor panels.\p"
    .string "One of them shocked me twice.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToInstallDoors::
    .string "I was up all night hanging those\n"
    .string "doors.\p"
    .string "They open in the wrong order on\n"
    .string "purpose.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToShoveBoulders::
    .string "I was up all night shoving those\n"
    .string "boulders about.\p"
    .string "My back has opinions.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToMakeMechadolls::
    .string "I was up all night building those\n"
    .string "dolls.\p"
    .string "They have begun answering back.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightPolishingFloors::
    .string "I was up all night polishing that\n"
    .string "floor.\p"
    .string "You slid past three of my best\n"
    .string "corners.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightSettingUpArrows::
    .string "I was up all night setting those\n"
    .string "arrows.\p"
    .string "They turned on me at four in the\n"
    .string "morning.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_AllNightToMakeMaze::
    .string "I was up all night building that\n"
    .string "mirror maze.\p"
    .string "I walked into myself twice.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_MakeNewTricksToStumpYou::
    .string "Go on, then. Out with you.\p"
    .string "I shall have something worse ready\n"
    .string "by the time you come back.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_YouHaveEarnedThisReward::
    .string "You have earned this. I say that\n"
    .string "rarely and I mean it now.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_FountainOfIdeasRunDry::
    .string "Eight rooms, and you took them\n"
    .string "all.\p"
    .string "My fountain of ideas has run dry,\n"
    .string "champion. That is your doing.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_DefeatedMePreferWhichTent::
    .string "So. A parting prize, and you shall\n"
    .string "choose it.\p"
    .string "Which?$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_ReceivedPrize::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the TRICK\n"
    .string "MASTER's prize!$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_LeavingOnJourney::
    .string "I am leaving on a journey!\p"
    .string "Somewhere with worse floors and\n"
    .string "better ideas.\p"
    .string "Wahahahaha!$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_NoRoomForThis::
    .string "Your BAG will not take it.\p"
    .string "I shall hold it. I shall complain\n"
    .string "about holding it.$"

Route110_TrickHouseEnd_Text_NoRoomInPC::
    .string "No room for it anywhere on you.\p"
    .string "Come back when you have made\n"
    .string "some.$"
